<title>USA: Winston Hotels applies for NYSE listing.</title>
<headline>Winston Hotels applies for NYSE listing.</headline>
<dateline>RALEIGH, N.C. 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Winston Hotels Inc said Wednesday it had applied to list its common stock on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company said it expects its shares to begin trading on the NYSE in mid-August. Winston's stock currently is traded on the Nasdaq National Market.</p>
<p>Winston Hotels is a real estate investment trust and owner of limited-service and extended-stay hotels.</p>
